{'symbol': 'O', 'date': '2022-03-15 18:45:00', 'title': '115TH COMMON STOCK MONTHLY DIVIDEND INCREASE DECLARED BY REALTY INCOME', 'text': "SAN DIEGO , MARCH 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REALTY INCOME CORPORATION (REALTY INCOME, NYSE: O), THE MONTHLY DIVIDEND COMPANY®, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED AN INCREASE IN THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK MONTHLY CASH DIVIDEND TO $0.247 PER SHARE FROM $0.2465 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON APRIL 15, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF APRIL 1, 2022."}